  "generations_before": {
    "prompt_0": "The future of artificial intelligence will be in using them for good.\n\nWe\u2019ve already seen an impressive amount of progress over the last decade, and that rate is only going to continue as we build on our experience with AI today. What used to take months now takes weeks",
